<task id="023" project="smart-todo-r5">
  <metadata>
    <title>Subtle channel urgency coloring + yellow-contrast audit (FR-08 / U-1 + F-1)</title>
    <phase>3: Top bar + filter + visuals</phase>
    <gate>003 complete</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies .ts/.tsx visual/styling code across the shared Kanban surface (useKanbanColumns.ts, KanbanBoard.tsx, KanbanCard.tsx) — FULL per CLAUDE.md §8 ("modifying .cs/.ts/.tsx" trigger); a11y-tagged with axe-core contrast gates.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Contained visual/token change to an already-token-based surface — not architectural — sonnet default per CLAUDE.md §8.5.</model-tier-reason>
